{"id":22005,"name":"永远的迷境饭","rarity":4,"path":"Shaman","desc":"同谐命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"轰隆隆——\\n迷境之外，风雨无休无止。\\n咕噜噜——\\n妖精们的神奇大煮锅，火焰不熄。\\n\\n<i>「撒上特制香料……」</i>\\n<i>「放入新鲜的蔬菜！」</i>\\n<i>「这一次，一定能研发成功！」</i>\\n\\n大煮锅又咕噜噜了起来，妖精们眼巴巴地望着。\\n<i>「要来了要来了！」</i>\\n一束强烈的亮光自锅底生出——\\n\\n看，大家都围了过来！\\n\\n……\\n\\n在那香气四溢的宴会上，来客举杯共祝奇妙的岁月——\\n\\n愿这梦中的乐土，永远温暖，永远欢乐！","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":22005,"name":"真香","desc":"使装备者的攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放战技后，攻击力提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，该效果最多叠加<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>层。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.16,0.08,3]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.2,0.1,3]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.24,0.12,3]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.28,0.14,3]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.32,0.16,3]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":21.6,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":15,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":47.52,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":33,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110231,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":115001,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":82.08,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":57,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":116.64,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":81,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110232,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":115002,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":151.2,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":105,"defence_add":2.25,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110233,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":115003,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":371.52,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":185.76,"attack_add":3.24,"defence_base":12